<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include("_head", { title: "Email" }) %>
</head>
<body data-page="email">
  <%- include("_nav", { page: "email" }) %>
  <main class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 md:py-10">
    <div class="tile">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Email sending</h2>
      <p class="text-dim text-sm mb-8">How the site sends quotes, confirmations and receipts to customers.</p>

      <div id="emailStatus" class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-muted text-sm"><i class="fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin mr-1"></i> Checking…</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Send a test email</h3>
        <p class="text-dim text-sm mb-3">Use an address that has never received mail from mcships.com to see which Gmail tab it lands in.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <input id="testEmailTo" type="email" placeholder="someone@gmail.com" class="input-admin flex-1 min-w-[240px]">
          <button onclick="sendTestEmail()" class="btn btn-primary px-5"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Send test</button>
        </div>
        <p id="testEmailMsg" class="hidden text-sm mt-3"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2"><i class="fas fa-star text-amber-300 mr-1"></i> Review request link</h3>
        <p class="text-dim text-sm mb-3">The day after a delivery, the customer gets a "How did we do?" email with this button. Paste your Google review link (Google Business Profile → Ask for reviews). Leave it empty and the email asks them to reply instead.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <input id="reviewUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://g.page/r/…/review" class="input-admin flex-1 min-w-[240px]">
          <button onclick="saveReviewUrl()" class="btn btn-primary px-5"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save</button>
        </div>
        <p id="reviewUrlMsg" class="hidden text-sm mt-3"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include("_modals") %>
  <%- include("_foot") %>
</body>
</html>
